<title>USA: Keystone Auto names financial chief.</title>
<headline>Keystone Auto names financial chief.</headline>
<dateline>POMONA, Calif. 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Keystone Automotive Industries Inc said Wednesday John M. Palumbo, 41, was appointed chief financial officer, a newly established position.</p>
<p>Palumbo joined Keystone Automotive in 1996 as vice president and treasurer.</p>
</text>
